│ Okay, let’s address this persistent issue    │
│ with the file path and then craft the patch. │
│ I’ve analyzed the context – the core problem │
│ is that CheckboxInput incorrectly sets       │
│ attrs['checked'] to True after encountering  │
│ the first True value in the                  │
│ SplitArrayField’s initial data. This is due  │
│ to the way get_context() modifies the attrs  │
│ dictionary. The fix involves preventing      │
│ get_context() from modifying                 │
│ attrs['checked'] when the field is initially │
│ populated.                                   │
│                                              │
│ Here’s the patch:                            │
│                                              │
│ ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓ │
│ ┃              modification 1              ┃ │
│ ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛ │
│                                              │
│                                              │
│  [file]/django/forms/widgets.py[/file]       │
│  [original] def get_context(self, name):     │
│      context = super().get_context(name)     │
│      if name == 'checked':                   │
│          attrs = self.attrs                  │
│          for value in self.data:             │
│              if value:                       │
│                  attrs['checked'] = True     │
│                  break                       │
│      context[name] = attrs                   │
│      return context[/original]               │
│  [patched] def get_context(self, name):      │
│      context = super().get_context(name)     │
│      if name == 'checked':                   │
│          attrs = self.attrs                  │
│          for value in self.data:             │
│              if value:                       │
│                  # Do not modify             │
│  attrs['checked']                            │
│                  pass                        │
│      context[name] = attrs                   │
│      return context[/patched]                │
